<title>SWITZERLAND: TENNIS-EUROPEAN INDOR CHAMPIONSHIP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-EUROPEAN INDOR CHAMPIONSHIP QUARTER-FINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results from the</p>
<p>European indoor championship on Friday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>4-Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Jennifer Capriati (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
<p>2-Iva Majoli (Croatia) beat 6-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 6-3 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>5-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) 6-3 6-1 3-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Silvia Farina (Italy) 6-1 6-1</p>
</text>
